After selecting an AWS database resource, the navigation changes

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7922109/203360967-12e8452b-a634-4535-bd3f-b49cdc18a157.png)

And the same for self hosted

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/7922109/203361004-742370ed-b6a7-4fb1-9dd2-3b86ecb825b3.png)

